	)
	(gr_text "STAGE 1 ROUTING\n- Hot loop: U2 pin 1 (SwC) -> D1 -> C7/C9 -> GND -> U2 pin 2.\n  Smallest possible, all on top.\n- Input: J6 +5V -> C5/C6 -> R11 -> U2 pin 7 / L1. Wide traces\n  (1 mm+): ~1 A peaks.\n- SW1 (L1 / D1 anode / U2 pin 1): short, small copper.\n- C8 at pin 3; R13/R14 at the FB pin (pin 5).\n- Join C5-C15 and U2 pins 2/4 GND on top, then several vias.\n- 20V leaves from C9/C15 to stage 2 (L2, U3) and Q5/R23."
		(at 19.107509 154.996234 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "a99b5c20-522b-4737-9d55-a68cd55a3d4a")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "LAYOUT NOTES (User.Comments: not fabricated)\n- 2 layers: top = parts + routing; bottom = one solid GND pour, short jumpers only.\n- One ground, no splits: close each power loop on top, then stitch to the plane.\n- Power flows left to right: J6 -> stage 1 -> stage 2 -> C1 -> K1 -> J2.\n- Each block is a KiCad group: drag it as a unit. No board outline yet."
		(at 25 40 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "38cb8ab8-98a2-491d-8239-9a042b9bc310")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "LOGIC ROUTING\n- I2C + power from J6/J1 straight to U1 and U4; no power currents through this area.\n- C16 at U1 pin 18, C17 at U4 pin 8 (VDD), each with its own GND via.\n- R33 / R19 / R17 = low ends of the ADC dividers, kept at U4. Add 10-100 nF from each\n  AIN pin to GND here (not in the schematic yet).\n- POL, FIRE, EN_HV leave U1 pins 14-16 as plain VIO logic lines: long runs are fine,\n  never parallel to SW1 (L1/D1) or SW2 (L2/Qa1/D2)."
		(at 60.275 51.902999 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "ff5138dd-6e80-4950-9ef2-014b8f6ccc99")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "STAGE 2 ROUTING\n- Hot loop: Qa1 drain -> D2 -> C1+ ... C1- -> Rcs1 -> Qa1 source.\n  Smallest possible. Consider a 100 nF 250 V ceramic from D2\n  cathode to Rcs1 GND (not in the schematic yet).\n- SW2 (Qa1 drain / L2 / D2 anode) swings 0-120 V: short,\n  nothing parallel to it.\n- Gate: U3 OUT -> Rg1 -> Qa1 gate; Dz1 right at gate/source.\n- CS: separate (Kelvin) trace from Rcs1 top pad to Rf1;\n  Cf1 at the U3 CS pin.\n- Quiet GND: Ct1, Cvref1, Cf1, Rfbb4, J7-J9 to U3 pin 5 (GND),\n  then one via to the plane.\n- FB node short: Rfbb1-4, Rz1, Rfbt3 at U3 pin 2."
		(at 77.33 158.975 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "e0ba4473-337d-4991-8516-ef9451a20b68")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "HV ROUTING\n- HV, HV_*, SW2, COIL_A/B, RETURN: HV net class,\n  1.0 mm clearance. Check the GND pour honours it.\n- R32 stays at HV: only its 3 V tap (AIN0) goes to U4.\n- D3 straight across C1. Rbl1-3 near C1.\n- Rfbt1-3 are HV class too: HV comes to Rfbt1,\n  the FB end (Rfbt3) sits at U3."
		(at 129.329999 158.975 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "b2b51bd6-a8b6-425d-86c9-ea02a512ac12")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "COIN ROUTING\n- C2-C4 at J3, then R7-R9,\n  pull-ups R4-R6.\n- Slow logic: any route back\n  to U1 pins 10-12."
		(at 188 62 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "038dda87-9260-4341-98c6-daf461cc7ac9")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "FIRE ROUTING\n- FIRE arrives as VIO logic (long is\n  fine); the level shift is here, by Q3.\n- GATE3 (R24 / R25 / D6 -> Q3 gate):\n  a few mm only.\n- Pulse loop: C1+ -> K1 -> J2 -> coin\n  relay -> K1 -> Q3 -> R26 -> GND -> C1-.\n  Keep compact; R26 GND via toward C1-.\n- ISENSE (R26 top) -> U4 AIN2 as a\n  signal; add 100 nF at AIN2."
		(at 188 84 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "5d6647eb-ea71-4d0c-bdef-cd23abb0669f")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "POL ROUTING\n- Q2, D4 at K1 coil pins 1/12.\n- K1 contacts are HV: HV (3, 8) and\n  RETURN (5, 10) cross, so route one\n  pair on the bottom layer."
		(at 188 112 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "4551a890-3544-4e89-aafb-d24ad5963141")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
